\section{The marking and the imported action}

Let $G$ be the simple Fischer group $\mathrm{Fi}_{22}$, in the previously
accepted action on $\Omega=\{0,\ldots,3509\}$. We use the right action
convention $x^{uv}=(x^u)^v$. The marking considered here is row $298$ of
the accepted free witness bank, with owner $621$ and row digest
\begin{center}\small\ttfamily
